{"4895600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crimson Spine","steam_appid":4895600,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5322200],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE A VAST WORLD CONSUMED BY ALCHEMY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely amnesiac, Raed roams the vast <strong>estate<\/strong> that belonged to his family in search of his memories. During her adventure, she learns more about her father, an alchemist leading dubious experiments, and about her mother, a seasoned knight whose path Raed has followed by becoming herself a great warrior.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the course of her quest, she will find the fragments of her old heart, allowing her to gradually recover her memory and discover the truth about her death. Perhaps then she will finally be able to return to her eternal sleep.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT USING A UNIQUE COMBAT MECHANIC<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought back to life thanks to a <strong>new heart<\/strong> implanted in her body, she can turn it into a weapon to face enemies who stand in her way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart controls gameplay via its <strong>BPMs<\/strong>. Depending on these, its <strong>posture<\/strong> and weapon will change. So when his <strong>BPMs<\/strong> are slow, Raed uses <strong>an axe<\/strong> with heavy gameplay. When they are medians, she uses <strong>a sword and shield<\/strong> with balanced gameplay. Finally, when they are high, Raed uses <strong>a rapier<\/strong> with fast and light gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>lower<\/strong> the <strong>BPM<\/strong> gauge and use the <strong>axe<\/strong>, perform <strong>perfect parries<\/strong> when enemies attack you.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>increase<\/strong> <strong>BPM<\/strong> and use the <strong>rapier<\/strong>, perform <strong>perfect dodges<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies can also <strong>directly<\/strong> <strong>influence<\/strong> <strong>BPM<\/strong> through their attacks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NAVIGATE A VAST WORLD CONSUMED BY ALCHEMY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely amnesiac, Raed roams the vast <strong>estate<\/strong> that belonged to his family in search of his memories. During her adventure, she learns more about her father, an alchemist leading dubious experiments, and about her mother, a seasoned knight whose path Raed has followed by becoming herself a great warrior.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the course of her quest, she will find the fragments of her old heart, allowing her to gradually recover her memory and discover the truth about her death. Perhaps then she will finally be able to return to her eternal sleep.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d32e576ca684e6562bbd7bc3ada1f624.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT USING A UNIQUE COMBAT MECHANIC<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought back to life thanks to a <strong>new heart<\/strong> implanted in her body, she can turn it into a weapon to face enemies who stand in her way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart controls gameplay via its <strong>BPMs<\/strong>. Depending on these, its <strong>posture<\/strong> and weapon will change. So when his <strong>BPMs<\/strong> are slow, Raed uses <strong>an axe<\/strong> with heavy gameplay. When they are medians, she uses <strong>a sword and shield<\/strong> with balanced gameplay. Finally, when they are high, Raed uses <strong>a rapier<\/strong> with fast and light gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/c9a0859f8c4dbdd462a977bd144433f6.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/d788198018ac8a995e1d784a7826e906.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=240 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/869876d13abe2d6ae9db8c2fb25c3280.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>lower<\/strong> the <strong>BPM<\/strong> gauge and use the <strong>axe<\/strong>, perform <strong>perfect parries<\/strong> when enemies attack you.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>increase<\/strong> <strong>BPM<\/strong> and use the <strong>rapier<\/strong>, perform <strong>perfect dodges<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies can also <strong>directly<\/strong> <strong>influence<\/strong> <strong>BPM<\/strong> through their attacks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/5125d943380f26b0ce604862bb7b670e.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.poster.avif?t=1793640412\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.webm?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/extras\/e340a53fa8e9e31515e72e1be59135df.mp4?t=1793640412\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A Metroidvania set in a dark fantasy world where Raed, a knight resurrected under mysterious circumstances, uses her new heart as a weapon to recover her lost memories.","supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/2583a09a61bf9fae7f58d5ee94ddaf279df70ca0\/header.jpg?t=1793640412","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/2c4367b3290d29a5a530e5ba4e1a2de67bd3b037\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793640412","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/2c4367b3290d29a5a530e5ba4e1a2de67bd3b037\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793640412","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6500 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 \/ AMD Radeon RX 570<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 750 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64 bits<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super \/ AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 750 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"GAMAGORA ICOM, ALL RIGHTS RESERVED","developers":["Crimson Spine Team","Gamagora ICOM"],"publishers":["Gamagora ICOM"],"demos":[{"appid":5322200,"description":""}],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":60,"description":"Gamepad Recommended"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":65,"description":"Subtitle Options"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/0c8bd17e0c6bd6e601715580a5799b87f5fdd7f8\/ss_0c8bd17e0c6bd6e601715580a5799b87f5fdd7f8.600x338.jpg?t=1793640412","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4895600\/0c8bd17e0c6bd6e601715580a5799b87f5fdd7f8\/ss_0c8bd17e0c6bd6e601715580a5799b87f5fdd7f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793640412"},{"id":1,"path_th